s and darkness claims the abbey.</div>\n   792→                \n   793→                \n   794→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   795→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   796→                    \n   797→                    <span class=\"tag\">Prince Prospero</span>\n   798→                    \n   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">The masked figure (Red Death)</span>\n   800→                    \n   801→                    <span class=\"tag\">Courtiers</span>\n   802→                    \n   803→                    <span class=\"tag\">Musicians</span>\n   804→                    \n   805→                    <span class=\"tag\">Buffoons</span>\n   806→                    \n   807→                    <span class=\"tag\">Improvisatori</span>\n   808→                    \n   809→                    <span class=\"tag\">Ballet-dancers</span>\n   810→                    \n   811→                    <span class=\"tag\">Beauty</span>\n   812→                    \n   813→                    \n   814→                </div>\n   815→                \n   816→            </div>\n   817→            \n   818→        </section>\n   819→        </div>\n   820→\n   821→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   822→        <section>\n   823→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n   824→\n   825→            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n   826→            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n   827→                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n   828→                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n   829→                    Show only low-confidence items\n   830→                </label>\n   831→            </div>\n   832→\n   833→            \n   834→\n   835→            \n   836→            <div class=\"character-group\">\n   837→ 